        "node_id": "n_7_ed9605",
        "thought_text": "Revise the logic for determining the earliest day to take an exam. Instead of updating current_day to a_i immediately, consider the maximum of (current_day + 1) and b_i for each exam, and then update current_day to a_i after determining the earliest possible day.",
